ivprofile:	kind of velocity profile
ivprofile=	1 sinus variation; total simulation time is given by Nv*period 
ivprofile=	2 ramp + steady; total simulation time is given by (time ramp + time steady)
ivprofile=	3 ramp + steady + ramp_down + stop_some_time; total simulation time is given by Nv*(time ramp + time steady + ramp_down + stop_some_time)
ivprofile=	4 ramp + steady + ramp_down + stop_some_time; total simulation time is given by Nv*(time ramp + time steady + ramp_down + stop_some_time) - top-speeds following to first defined as +-increments

0			input-type =0 start, =1 restart
4			number of processors
3			ivprofile =1, 2, 3 or 4; 1=sinus, 2=ramp+steady, 3=ramp+stready+ramp_down+stop, 4=ramp+stready+ramp_down+stop
0.01		initial time step [s]

2			if ivprofile =1: number of periods Nv
1.E-01		if ivprofile =1: stroke length [m]
1.E-01		if ivprofile =1: period of the sinusoidal velocity variation [s]

1.E-00		if ivprofile =2: max velocity [m/s]
1.E-01		if ivprofile =2: period of the ramp variation [s]
2.E-00		if ivprofile =2: simulation time in the zero velocity regime

2			if ivprofile =3: number of periods Nv
2.8E-02		if ivprofile =3: max velocity [m/s]
7.5E+00		if ivprofile =3: period of the ramp variation [s]
1.E-03		if ivprofile =3: simulation time in the steady velocity regime [s]
7.5E+00		if ivprofile =3: period of the ramp variation during speed decrease [s]
17.5E-00		if ivprofile =3: simulation time in the zero velocity regime [s]

2			if ivprofile =4: number of periods Nv
1.8E-02		if ivprofile =4: max velocity [m/s]
5.5E+00		if ivprofile =4: period of the ramp variation [s]
1.E-03		if ivprofile =4: simulation time in the steady velocity regime [s]
5.5E+00		if ivprofile =4: period of the ramp variation during speed decrease [s]
17.5E-00		if ivprofile =4: simulation time in the zero velocity regime [s]
0.E-02		2nd increment
1.E-02		3rd increment
1.E-02		N.. increment
